  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Logic :** (2nd number - 1st number) = (3rd number ÷ 4)\n\n**Given :**\n\n \n• (19, 37, 72)\n\n37 - 19 = 72 ÷ 4\n\n18 = 18 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (15, 29, 56)\n\n29 - 15 = 56 ÷ 4\n\n14 = 14 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (11, 21, 40)\n\n21 - 11 = 40 ÷ 4\n\n**10 = 10 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (16, 30, 62)\n\n30 - 16 = 62 ÷ 4\n\n14 ≠ 15.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (18, 35, 69)\n\n35 - 18 = 69 ÷ 4\n\n17 ≠ 17.25 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (12, 25, 50)\n\n25 - 12 = 50 ÷ 4\n\n13 ≠ 12.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (1)\"** is the correct answer.",
